    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_query_cache" kindref="compound">QueryCache</ref></para>
<para>A simple thread-safe LRU cache for AS-OF query results. Each entry maps a (table_name, as_of) key to the list of <ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_versioned_document" kindref="compound">VersionedDocument</ref> rows returned by a previous queryAsOf() call.</para>
<para>Intended usage pattern: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_query_cache_1a4ffc11aad7e8678d5d8efd127eb8324d" kindref="member">QueryCache</ref><sp/>cache(128);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>keep<sp/>up<sp/>to<sp/>128<sp/>distinct<sp/>(table,<sp/>time)<sp/>entries</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>rows<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1detail_1a73ea2f5d7970de7d4b77d1651a280b1c" kindref="member">detail::queryAsOfCached</ref>(table,<sp/>as_of,<sp/>cache);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Thread-safety: all public methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
